  "question": {
    "text": "A fighter plane, flying horizontally with a speed $360 \\mathrm{kmph}$ at an altitude of $500 \\mathrm{~m}$ drops a bomb for a target straight ahead of it on the ground. The bomb .should be dropped at what approximate distance ahead of the target ? Assume that acceleration due to gravity $(\\mathrm{g})$ is $10 \\mathrm{~ms}^{-2}$. Also neglect air drag",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
